    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Kemet X</i>, play as warrior-prince Jaraqo. Command your spacecraft across distant stars, face off against powerful galactic overlords, and carve your path to kingship. Designed as a <strong>short game</strong>, each episode of the <i>Kemet X</i> series will unveil a new stage in Jaraqo\u2019s epic journey, pushing you deeper into the cosmos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552770/extras/4b83143d84cfe0e795d09b84bef9fe91.poster.avif?t=1752415576\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552770/extras/4b83143d84cfe0e795d09b84bef9fe91.webm?t=1752415576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552770/extras/4b83143d84cfe0e795d09b84bef9fe91.mp4?t=1752415576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in an alternate history where the empires of Kemet <strong> (Ancient Nubia-Egypt)</strong> remained unconquered, Kemet X blends African history with Afro-futurism for a unique narrative adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552770/extras/d63ba79020c9dd5aed18ce9377b5b0da.poster.avif?t=1752415576\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552770/extras/d63ba79020c9dd5aed18ce9377b5b0da.webm?t=1752415576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552770/extras/d63ba79020c9dd5aed18ce9377b5b0da.mp4?t=1752415576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available on PC and VR via Virtual Desktop, <i>Kemet X</i> offers a truly immersive experience. While in VR, play seamlessly using an Xbox controller or keyboard. For the ultimate gameplay, enjoy <i>Kemet X</i> on a large screen in VR via Virtual Desktop, with an Ethernet connection for peak performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552770/extras/050047ca532732f11374f3c496039c17.avif?t=1752415576\" data-has-big /></span>Support the journey by wishlisting Kemet X on Steam today.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552770/extras/58ab3136482e9e0560d7200d8ff5f698.avif?t=1752415576\" data-has-big /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For fans of films like <i>Black Panther</i> and <i>The Woman King</i></strong>: Immerse yourself in a rich, story-driven adventure inspired by Afrocentric narratives and epic storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A solo-developed creation</strong>: Crafted by indie developer Theo Dusu, <i>Kemet X</i> delivers a captivating journey with an unforgettable ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ancient Languages</strong> \u2013 Experience <strong>Nobiin</strong>, one of the world\u2019s most ancient living languages, through in-game segments designed to preserve and showcase Africa\u2019s linguistic heritage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Educational Segments</strong> \u2013 Learn about the <strong>real history of Ancient Nubia and Egypt</strong>, their rulers and enduring legacies.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Kemet X</i>, play as warrior-prince Jaraqo. Command your spacecraft across distant stars, face off against powerful galactic overlords, and carve your path to kingship. Designed as a <strong>short game</strong>, each episode of the <i>Kemet X</i> series will unveil a new stage in Jaraqo\u2019s epic journey, pushing you deeper into the cosmos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552770/extras/4b83143d84cfe0e795d09b84bef9fe91.poster.avif?t=1752415576\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552770/extras/4b83143d84cfe0e795d09b84bef9fe91.webm?t=1752415576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552770/extras/4b83143d84cfe0e795d09b84bef9fe91.mp4?t=1752415576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in an alternate history where the empires of Kemet <strong> (Ancient Nubia-Egypt)</strong> remained unconquered, Kemet X blends African history with Afro-futurism for a unique narrative adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552770/extras/d63ba79020c9dd5aed18ce9377b5b0da.poster.avif?t=1752415576\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552770/extras/d63ba79020c9dd5aed18ce9377b5b0da.webm?t=1752415576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552770/extras/d63ba79020c9dd5aed18ce9377b5b0da.mp4?t=1752415576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available on PC and VR via Virtual Desktop, <i>Kemet X</i> offers a truly immersive experience. While in VR, play seamlessly using an Xbox controller or keyboard. For the ultimate gameplay, enjoy <i>Kemet X</i> on a large screen in VR via Virtual Desktop, with an Ethernet connection for peak performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552770/extras/050047ca532732f11374f3c496039c17.avif?t=1752415576\" data-has-big /></span>Support the journey by wishlisting Kemet X on Steam today.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552770/extras/58ab3136482e9e0560d7200d8ff5f698.avif?t=1752415576\" data-has-big /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For fans of films like <i>Black Panther</i> and <i>The Woman King</i></strong>: Immerse yourself in a rich, story-driven adventure inspired by Afrocentric narratives and epic storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A solo-developed creation</strong>: Crafted by indie developer Theo Dusu, <i>Kemet X</i> delivers a captivating journey with an unforgettable ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ancient Languages</strong> \u2013 Experience <strong>Nobiin</strong>, one of the world\u2019s most ancient living languages, through in-game segments designed to preserve and showcase Africa\u2019s linguistic heritage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Educational Segments</strong> \u2013 Learn about the <strong>real history of Ancient Nubia and Egypt</strong>, their rulers and enduring legacies.</p></li></ul>",
