    "pc_requirements": {
        "minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i5-6600K / AMD FX-6300 (or any 4-core, ~3.5GHz CPU)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 (or 750 Ti) / AMD Radeon HD 7770 (or R7 260X) \u2013 1\u20132 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Direct X Compatible<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Optimised for VR via Virtual Desktop - Kemet X is not optimised for SteamVR. To play in VR, please use a big screen via Virtual Desktop, which supports Meta Quest 2, Quest 3, Quest Pro, and Pico headsets. Additionally, a gamepad or keyboard is required for input, as VR motion controllers are not supported.<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Integrated graphics (Intel HD, Iris) might run the game at lower settings/resolution but are not recommended for a smooth experience. If playing with a gamepad, you may occasionally need to visit websites. In such cases, you will revert to using a keyboard and mouse.</li></ul>",
        "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"
